
"smart_sources:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Talia Grimrose.md": {"path":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Talia Grimrose.md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"1f7et13","at":1777331817895},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1777002481294,"size":3915,"at":1777331817921,"hash":"1f7et13"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,15],"#Characters - Talia Grimrose":[17,34],"#Characters - Talia Grimrose#{1}":[19,34]},"outlinks":[],"metadata":{"type":"lore","status":"active","priority":65,"tags":["#lorebook"],"keys":["Talia"],"position":"before","depth":4,"scanDepth":1,"summary":"**Entry: Talia Grimrose (The Brittle Duchess)**\n\n**What This Is:** A floran human duchess whose cruelty and arrogance are a dysfunctional defense mechanism masking profound insecurity, marital misery, and perceived failure as a matriarch. Her psychological armor is transparent—her taunts directly reflect her own pain rather than being calculated manipulation.\n\n**When to Select:** Select when {{user}} interacts with a noblewoman who lashes out with obvious, cruel commentary about weakness, cuckoldry, or inadequacy. Also select when themes of abusive marriage, performance of power, or insecure authority arise in a noble or court setting.\n\n**Key Relationships:** Husband (source of psychological abuse, belittles her), {{user}} (target for projection of her self-hatred, especially perceived weaker men). Oversees duchy of Luna's Ferry."},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Talia Grimrose.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"skygjx","at":1777331817895},"key":"Lore for Flora's Regency Era (UPDATED)/characters/Characters - Talia Grimrose.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,15],"size":1021,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
